1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,000
Subs by Mkrm

2
00:01:26,520 --> 00:01:27,200
Meatball!

3
00:01:28,060 --> 00:01:29,340
Where are the drinks your Dad sponsored?

4
00:01:29,800 --> 00:01:30,780
They should be arriving soon.

5
00:01:31,240 --> 00:01:32,220
If we wait for your dad's drinks to get here,

6
00:01:32,680 --> 00:01:34,620
I might have already died of thirst.

7
00:01:35,000 --> 00:01:36,060
Where's Leo?

8
00:01:36,220 --> 00:01:37,470
Coach Tony fell and got injured.

9
00:01:37,480 --> 00:01:38,460
He's my Cousin.

10
00:01:39,400 --> 00:01:41,820
But what does that have to do with the Mysterious Person?

11
00:01:42,280 --> 00:01:43,260
Of course we have evidence.

12
00:01:43,720 --> 00:01:45,100
Today, let's settle this fair and square.

13
00:01:45,110 --> 00:01:45,790
Alright.

14
00:01:46,600 --> 00:01:49,500
Don't panic when these things happen. Stay calm.

15
00:01:49,960 --> 00:01:51,420
Leo. Starting from today,

16
00:01:51,880 --> 00:01:54,300
all Jianghai Team Training and Matches

17
00:01:55,040 --> 00:01:56,220
are your full responsibility.

18
00:01:59,000 --> 00:02:03,000
Episode 33

19
00:02:04,360 --> 00:02:06,300
Don't talk nonsense, or I'll get mad.

20
00:02:07,240 --> 00:02:08,190
Don't.

21
00:02:08,200 --> 00:02:10,620
I'm just trying to cheer you up.

22
00:02:13,660 --> 00:02:14,940
Seriously though,

23
00:02:15,200 --> 00:02:16,380
you should really consider

24
00:02:16,840 --> 00:02:17,920
finding someone to properly take care of you.

25
00:02:22,600 --> 00:02:24,060
Ever since graduating from the Sports Academy,

26
00:02:24,520 --> 00:02:25,500
I haven't had that kind of drive anymore.

27
00:02:26,920 --> 00:02:28,960
I guess I'll never have a chance
like that in this life.

28
00:02:31,720 --> 00:02:32,700
What are you talking about?

29
00:02:33,160 --> 00:02:34,620
Sounds like you're blaming me for holding you back.

30
00:02:37,960 --> 00:02:38,940
That's not what I meant.

31
00:02:44,860 --> 00:02:46,140
It's getting cold. Eat up.

32
00:02:53,600 --> 00:02:54,300
Who is it?

33
00:03:01,480 --> 00:03:03,420
Senior Brother, what happened to you?

34
00:03:04,840 --> 00:03:06,300
Seeing you in this state... Are you okay?

35
00:03:07,900 --> 00:03:09,180
Are you feeling any better?

36
00:03:10,120 --> 00:03:12,540
You're pretty well-informed, William.

37
00:03:13,480 --> 00:03:14,460
Even our Senior Sister knows about it.

38
00:03:14,920 --> 00:03:16,860
As your Junior, I should know too.

39
00:03:17,800 --> 00:03:18,780
Oh, right,

40
00:03:20,200 --> 00:03:21,660
I also brought this back for you.

41
00:03:22,120 --> 00:03:24,460
I've benefited greatly from it.

42
00:03:27,200 --> 00:03:27,900
William.

43
00:03:29,400 --> 00:03:31,260
Why didn't you tell me earlier

44
00:03:32,200 --> 00:03:33,660
about you being the Coach of the Saint Qiao Team?

45
00:03:34,600 --> 00:03:37,980
What a coincidence. I was just appointed.

46
00:03:38,920 --> 00:03:40,380
I didn't know before either.

47
00:03:40,530 --> 00:03:41,570
Nonsense!

48
00:03:42,280 --> 00:03:43,740
When you tricked Tony into giving
you that Secret Yo-Yo Manual,

49
00:03:44,100 --> 00:03:44,930
you had already been appointed.

50
00:03:46,400 --> 00:03:48,060
Only your Senior Brother was kept in the dark.

51
00:03:50,040 --> 00:03:51,420
What do you mean by "trick"?

52
00:03:52,160 --> 00:03:53,340
You make it sound so bad, Sarah.

53
00:03:55,720 --> 00:03:56,700
Sarah.

54
00:03:58,120 --> 00:04:00,060
I think you're not much different.

55
00:04:01,180 --> 00:04:02,460
Back in the Sports Academy,

56
00:04:02,920 --> 00:04:04,380
didn't you also look down on our Senior Brother?

57
00:04:05,800 --> 00:04:09,180
And now, you're probably only
here to check out that Manual,

58
00:04:10,120 --> 00:04:12,060
and butter up our Senior Brother.

59
00:04:12,250 --> 00:04:12,990
You're talking nonsense!

60
00:04:15,400 --> 00:04:16,860
I'm not sneaky and underhanded like you.

61
00:04:17,320 --> 00:04:18,300
Using the excuse of being an old Classmate,

62
00:04:18,760 --> 00:04:20,220
to steal other people's Secrets.

63
00:04:22,120 --> 00:04:23,580
I just did what you were planning to do,

64
00:04:24,040 --> 00:04:25,500
but I succeeded before you did.

65
00:04:27,880 --> 00:04:29,820
Does that infuriate you?

66
00:04:30,100 --> 00:04:30,780
Enough!

67
00:04:35,260 --> 00:04:37,500
You're really projecting your
own petty motives onto others!

68
00:04:38,240 --> 00:04:40,860
Between me and Tony,
it's just normal fair Competition.

69
00:04:41,320 --> 00:04:42,300
Don't compare me to you.

70
00:04:42,760 --> 00:04:44,700
I don't want to be compared to you either.

71
00:04:46,600 --> 00:04:47,760
In terms of conditions and strength,

72
00:04:49,760 --> 00:04:52,860
Our Saint Qiao Team is far above your Chengnan Team.

73
00:04:55,040 --> 00:04:57,660
There's really no comparison.

74
00:04:58,120 --> 00:04:59,100
I said Enough!

75
00:05:00,660 --> 00:05:01,500
William,

76
00:05:02,920 --> 00:05:05,340
Whether it's the quality of
your Team or your Character,

77
00:05:06,280 --> 00:05:07,260
we've already seen enough of both.

78
00:05:09,160 --> 00:05:10,140
Now please leave.

79
00:05:11,080 --> 00:05:14,460
We'll settle this on the Competition Stage.

80
00:05:16,360 --> 00:05:18,300
Fine, Senior Brother.

81
00:05:19,720 --> 00:05:21,180
Since you put it that way,

82
00:05:24,040 --> 00:05:25,980
let me be honest with you.

83
00:05:26,920 --> 00:05:30,300
Your Chengnan Team, your Jianghai Team,

84
00:05:30,760 --> 00:05:32,700
are just third-rate School Teams.

85
00:05:35,080 --> 00:05:36,060
Our Saint Qiao Team

86
00:05:36,520 --> 00:05:38,460
doesn't even consider you as Competition.

87
00:05:41,800 --> 00:05:43,740
That Championship will be ours.

88
00:05:45,440 --> 00:05:46,620
And don't go complaining later

89
00:05:47,080 --> 00:05:49,660
that I won because I peeked at your Secret Manual.

90
00:05:50,270 --> 00:05:51,910
To be honest,

91
00:05:52,360 --> 00:05:53,820
that Secret Manual of yours...

92
00:05:54,280 --> 00:05:57,180
as far as I'm concerned, is complete nonsense.

93
00:06:01,280 --> 00:06:01,980
Get out!

94
00:06:03,100 --> 00:06:03,900
You still won't leave?

95
00:06:04,600 --> 00:06:06,000
Hmph!

96
00:06:07,800 --> 00:06:09,180
I don't want to stay long either.

97
00:06:16,840 --> 00:06:18,300
You really shouldn't let someone like him get to you.

98
00:06:21,640 --> 00:06:23,580
I'm not angry at William,

99
00:06:27,200 --> 00:06:28,860
I'm angry at myself.

100
00:06:31,720 --> 00:06:34,140
Am I just a completely incompetent Coach?

101
00:06:35,560 --> 00:06:37,020
I suppose so.

102
00:06:45,640 --> 00:06:47,580
Forget it, don't be mad.

103
00:06:54,080 --> 00:06:55,260
Don't be mad.

104
00:06:55,720 --> 00:06:58,140
Here, have some food.

105
00:07:01,960 --> 00:07:02,700
I'll do it myself.

106
00:07:12,250 --> 00:07:12,910
In my whole life,

107
00:07:13,760 --> 00:07:15,470
I've never received such VIP treatment.

108
00:07:16,480 --> 00:07:19,260
Having someone cook me meals, I'm content.

109
00:07:31,520 --> 00:07:32,700
It's delicious.

110
00:07:35,080 --> 00:07:36,540
You focus on recovering from your Injury.

111
00:07:37,000 --> 00:07:38,940
If your Jianghai Team runs into any trouble at all,

112
00:07:39,400 --> 00:07:40,860
they can just reach out to me.

113
00:07:47,080 --> 00:07:49,020
I'll thank you on behalf of the kids first.

114
00:08:39,380 --> 00:08:40,380
Cold Cat.

115
00:08:40,540 --> 00:08:41,440
Hot Dog.

116
00:08:49,960 --> 00:08:51,420
That's the guy from the photo.

117
00:09:16,060 --> 00:09:17,130
What do you want?

118
00:09:20,860 --> 00:09:21,660
Where's Leo?

119
00:09:22,300 --> 00:09:23,580
Is this how you look for someone?

120
00:09:24,700 --> 00:09:25,800
So rude.

121
00:09:26,620 --> 00:09:28,860
No manners.

122
00:09:29,020 --> 00:09:29,920
Barging in like this,

123
00:09:30,180 --> 00:09:31,260
do you think you own the place?

124
00:09:31,720 --> 00:09:33,180
Didn't you hear our Captain asking you?

125
00:09:35,080 --> 00:09:36,060
Where is Leo?

126
00:09:37,280 --> 00:09:40,380
I think he's hiding.

127
00:09:41,800 --> 00:09:43,740
You mean he fled after hearing the news?

128
00:09:44,680 --> 00:09:47,580
Yeah, probably ran off with his tail between his legs!

129
00:09:48,220 --> 00:09:49,500
Don't be too arrogant.

130
00:09:49,960 --> 00:09:51,420
You've only won a few Matches.

131
00:09:52,000 --> 00:09:53,820
This is what they call letting a
little success go to your head.

132
00:09:54,560 --> 00:09:57,180
It's called having your tail up in the sky.

133
00:09:58,120 --> 00:09:59,580
Tail up "to" the sky.

134
00:10:01,860 --> 00:10:04,380
Since Leo doesn't dare show up,

135
00:10:08,380 --> 00:10:10,140
I won't waste my breath on you.

136
00:10:11,840 --> 00:10:13,500
Pass this message to Leo:

137
00:10:15,780 --> 00:10:16,730
I came to China

138
00:10:18,180 --> 00:10:21,530
just so he gets humiliated at the Official Tournament.

139
00:10:27,680 --> 00:10:28,860
And also,

140
00:10:34,500 --> 00:10:37,500
You don't need to train so hard.

141
00:10:39,880 --> 00:10:41,800
The Blazing Teens Yo-Yo Tournament,

142
00:10:43,040 --> 00:10:44,700
has nothing to do with you.

143
00:10:46,200 --> 00:10:49,980
The Championship is absolutely guaranteed
to go to our Saint Qiao Team.

144
00:10:58,800 --> 00:10:59,300
Let's go.

145
00:10:59,680 --> 00:11:00,580
Wait!

146
00:11:01,480 --> 00:11:02,940
What do you think the Jianghai Team is?

147
00:11:03,400 --> 00:11:05,820
Somewhere you can just come and go?

148
00:11:06,760 --> 00:11:08,790
Declaring yourselves Champions
before the Tournament even starts.

149
00:11:09,920 --> 00:11:11,100
What kind of skill is that?

150
00:11:19,240 --> 00:11:21,660
So what do you want to do?

151
00:11:24,520 --> 00:11:28,380
If you've got guts, bring Leo out here.

152
00:11:29,800 --> 00:11:31,260
Allow me to make a grand introduction.

153
00:11:32,480 --> 00:11:35,940
This is the renowned Captain of the Saint Qiao Team...

154
00:11:36,650 --> 00:11:37,980
Mr. Michael.

155
00:11:39,200 --> 00:11:42,300
How about that? A name that commands respect, right?

156
00:11:43,240 --> 00:11:44,700
I've only heard of a "Microphone."

157
00:11:45,920 --> 00:11:47,580
Never heard of any Michael.

158
00:11:48,520 --> 00:11:50,460
A Microphone is what you use to shout slogans.

159
00:11:51,880 --> 00:11:53,340
Hey, chubby.

160
00:11:54,280 --> 00:11:56,220
Why don't you step up and warm us up first?

161
00:11:56,680 --> 00:11:58,120
Have a little match with me.

162
00:11:58,600 --> 00:12:00,060
You're on! Who are you trying to scare?

163
00:12:01,280 --> 00:12:03,420
It's rare that the Great Virus comes knocking on our door.

164
00:12:03,880 --> 00:12:05,340
Let me get a taste first.

165
00:12:05,800 --> 00:12:08,020
Really, just you?

166
00:12:09,640 --> 00:12:11,380
You'll have to go through me first.

167
00:12:11,390 --> 00:12:14,460
It's a deal. After we Compete,

168
00:12:14,920 --> 00:12:16,380
I don't want to see you buzzing around

169
00:12:16,640 --> 00:12:17,820
the Jianghai Team ever again.

170
00:12:19,040 --> 00:12:20,220
Since you're so eager to embarrass yourself,

171
00:12:21,640 --> 00:12:22,620
I'll gladly oblige.

172
00:12:54,760 --> 00:12:55,890
Ready, handsome?

173
00:12:57,640 --> 00:13:00,340
Oh wait, You're going to lose very badly.

174
00:13:01,000 --> 00:13:02,460
Cut the crap! Make your move.

175
00:13:03,200 --> 00:13:04,380
I hate people who talk too much.

176
00:14:20,480 --> 00:14:21,660
Twin Serpent Rift!

177
00:14:23,900 --> 00:14:23,300
Dragons Soaring Over the Sun!

178
00:14:41,800 --> 00:14:44,190
Yeah!

179
00:14:44,200 --> 00:14:45,660
That was beautiful!

180
00:14:45,920 --> 00:14:47,580
We won!

181
00:14:49,480 --> 00:14:49,980
Total victory!

182
00:14:53,000 --> 00:14:54,000
Buzz off.

183
00:14:56,000 --> 00:14:56,700
Wow...

184
00:15:01,000 --> 00:15:01,980
So fast!

185
00:15:02,920 --> 00:15:03,900
Hey, Virus!

186
00:15:04,640 --> 00:15:06,300
Let's settle this in one Move.

187
00:15:07,040 --> 00:15:08,220
To be perfectly honest,

188
00:15:10,020 --> 00:15:11,100
with the exception of Leo,

189
00:15:13,000 --> 00:15:15,900
I really have absolutely zero interest

190
00:15:16,360 --> 00:15:18,300
in battling frogs at the bottom
of the well like you.

191
00:15:18,760 --> 00:15:22,620
But since you've made the Challenge so clear...

192
00:15:24,040 --> 00:15:25,020
I'll agree.

193
00:15:26,440 --> 00:15:28,860
I'll let you copy my Move, exactly as I do it, one time.

194
00:15:31,040 --> 00:15:32,220
If you succeed,

195
00:15:34,600 --> 00:15:36,060
I'll accept your terms.

196
00:15:36,600 --> 00:15:37,980
Don't look down on people.

197
00:15:39,400 --> 00:15:40,380
No helping it.

198
00:15:41,320 --> 00:15:42,990
You're just too low.

199
00:15:44,200 --> 00:15:44,700
Well?

200
00:15:45,640 --> 00:15:46,110
Make your move.

201
00:16:04,000 --> 00:16:06,400
[Name: Michael] [Team: Saint Qiao Captain]
[Yo-Yo: Storm Falcon] [Special Move: Invincible Eagle]

202
00:16:06,500 --> 00:16:07,620
Watch closely.

203
00:16:22,020 --> 00:16:24,060
Stealth Battle Hawk!

204
00:16:51,680 --> 00:16:52,860
How about that?

205
00:16:54,760 --> 00:16:55,740
Do it again if you've got the skill.

206
00:16:56,280 --> 00:16:57,660
We didn't see clearly.

207
00:16:58,300 --> 00:17:00,060
Our Captain's Stealth Battle Hawk

208
00:17:01,000 --> 00:17:02,940
is never done a second time.

209
00:17:03,100 --> 00:17:03,900
So powerful!

210
00:17:04,840 --> 00:17:07,260
This Speed is impossible for a normal person.

211
00:17:10,300 --> 00:17:13,020
Seems you've got a good eye.

212
00:17:15,880 --> 00:17:18,780
This is my unparalleled Western Speed Style.

213
00:17:19,240 --> 00:17:20,700
Tell Leo,

214
00:17:21,440 --> 00:17:23,100
his Eastern Intuition

215
00:17:23,560 --> 00:17:26,940
can never defeat my Western Speed.

216
00:17:30,760 --> 00:17:31,740
Let's go!

217
00:18:16,840 --> 00:18:17,820
Where on earth is Leo?

218
00:18:19,320 --> 00:18:21,660
No wonder Leo's been so preoccupied lately.

219
00:18:22,600 --> 00:18:23,100
Yes.

220
00:18:23,560 --> 00:18:25,980
When Shawn said the Virus was from the US,

221
00:18:26,440 --> 00:18:28,380
Leo's expression seemed really off.

222
00:18:29,320 --> 00:18:31,230
I bet Leo is secretly practicing

223
00:18:31,240 --> 00:18:32,700
a Signature Move to use against Michael.

224
00:18:33,640 --> 00:18:35,580
What's the point of practicing?

225
00:18:36,500 --> 00:18:38,100
I don't think it's possible for Leo

226
00:18:38,240 --> 00:18:39,800
to ever match Michael's Speed.

227
00:18:39,960 --> 00:18:40,760
Teddy!

228
00:18:40,920 --> 00:18:42,780
Stop boosting the enemy's ego and crushing our own!

229
00:18:44,680 --> 00:18:45,660
Leo!

230
00:18:52,840 --> 00:18:53,820
Yes.

231
00:18:54,280 --> 00:18:56,700
Michael is the Champion who beat me

232
00:18:58,120 --> 00:18:59,580
at the last US Tournament.

233
00:18:59,740 --> 00:19:00,540
I told you,

234
00:19:01,000 --> 00:19:02,460
we're simply no match for them.

235
00:19:05,500 --> 00:19:06,780
Actually, the reason I returned home

236
00:19:07,240 --> 00:19:09,660
was to immerse myself in traditional Chinese culture,

237
00:19:10,120 --> 00:19:12,060
to find the roots of the Eastern Intuition Style.

238
00:19:13,180 --> 00:19:14,430
to help me quickly

239
00:19:14,440 --> 00:19:16,380
reach the highest level of the Crimson Holy Light.

240
00:19:17,400 --> 00:19:18,300
I told Michael

241
00:19:19,240 --> 00:19:20,220
that at the next US Tournament.

242
00:19:21,060 --> 00:19:22,620
I'd defeat his Western Speed Style.

243
00:19:24,220 --> 00:19:25,020
No wonder.

244
00:19:25,960 --> 00:19:26,940
He told us to tell you

245
00:19:27,400 --> 00:19:28,350
he came to China

246
00:19:28,360 --> 00:19:30,780
just to humiliate you in the Tournament.

247
00:19:31,900 --> 00:19:34,140
And he said your Eastern Intuition

248
00:19:34,600 --> 00:19:36,380
can never defeat his Western Speed.

249
00:19:38,240 --> 00:19:38,920
I see.

250
00:19:39,430 --> 00:19:40,570
So he came here

251
00:19:40,840 --> 00:19:42,300
to beat me at the China Tournament.

252
00:19:43,240 --> 00:19:44,050
To completely crush my confidence.

253
00:19:44,760 --> 00:19:46,620
Then your Blazing Light Wave

254
00:19:46,780 --> 00:19:48,540
needs to reach the highest level to beat him!

255
00:19:49,480 --> 00:19:50,940
Oh no, the Tournament is about to start.

256
00:19:51,400 --> 00:19:52,380
There's not much time left.

257
00:19:53,320 --> 00:19:55,260
What do you mean, Blazing Light Wave?

258
00:19:56,680 --> 00:19:58,620
Leo wants to take his Eastern Intuition Style

259
00:19:59,080 --> 00:20:00,060
to an even higher level.

260
00:20:01,000 --> 00:20:02,940
so he has to use the Blazing Light Wave to master

261
00:20:03,400 --> 00:20:05,330
the Red, Orange, Yellow, Green, Cyan, Purple, and Blue...

262
00:20:05,440 --> 00:20:07,790
the Seven Holy Light moves!

263
00:20:09,160 --> 00:20:12,060
Only then can Blazing Light Wave
evolve into Crimson Holy Light.

264
00:20:13,480 --> 00:20:15,900
Only by mastering the Ultimate
level of Crimson Holy Light

265
00:20:16,840 --> 00:20:20,700
can you reach the Final Signature Move of the Blazing Series.

266
00:20:22,120 --> 00:20:23,100
"The Ultimate Holy Light"

267
00:20:24,040 --> 00:20:25,020
Only The Ultimate Holy Light

268
00:20:25,480 --> 00:20:27,900
can defeat Michael's Storm Falcon.

269
00:20:29,320 --> 00:20:30,300
Alright, I've explained it all.

270
00:20:31,240 --> 00:20:31,610
Do you understand?

271
00:20:31,620 --> 00:20:33,500
Wow, that's amazing!

272
00:20:33,640 --> 00:20:35,100
How do you know all that?

273
00:20:35,560 --> 00:20:36,060
Of course.

274
00:20:36,520 --> 00:20:39,900
As the Future Distinguished
Critic of the Yo-Yo World,

275
00:20:40,360 --> 00:20:41,790
I constantly follow

276
00:20:41,800 --> 00:20:43,260
the Global Yo-Yo scene.

277
00:20:43,900 --> 00:20:46,110
And I'm constantly studying

278
